                            <p></p><h3>Definition of "ec92":</h3><p><img src="/images/tubes/EC92_tube.jpg" width="80" class="thumb shaft" />The <b>EC92</b> is a triode vacuum tube found in some vintage Neumann/Gefell mics, such as the CMV-563. It is identical to the 6AB4. </p><p>NOS Telefunken EC92 tubes can be found on Ebay from $5-$60.</p><p>Read more about the <a href="http://www.radiomuseum.org/tubes/tube_ec92.html">EC92</a>.</p>
